  # AI Replacing Jobs 2026: What The Layoff Wave Really Means
  
  ![](https://assets.cdn.filesafe.space/fkbgxTGgbrgeJWiBNY3n/media/a560ca0b-d99d-4acc-91b0-ce8dbd9855ef.png)
  
