  # Top 20 Predictions from Experts on AI Job Loss
  
  [![Cem Dilmegani](https://aimultiple.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/headshot-of-Cem-Dilmegani-160x160.png.webp)](https://aimultiple.com/author/cem-dilmegani)
  
  [Cem Dilmegani](https://aimultiple.com/author/cem-dilmegani)
  
  with
  
  [Sıla Ermut](https://aimultiple.com/author/sila-ermut)
  
  updated on Apr 6, 2026
  
  See our [ethical norms](https://aimultiple.com/commitments)
  
  As a McKinsey consultant, I helped enterprises adopt new technology for a decade. My quick answers on AI job loss:
  
  - **How will AI impact jobs?** 90% of all white-collar corporate roles that I have seen can be automated with current AI models and the right agent harness. [We predict](https://aimultiple.com/ai-job-loss#aimultiple-2026) this transformation to take a decade due to system and process complexity.
  - **What will this lead to?** Initially, immense corporate profits. However, mass underemployment would lead to a depression.
  - **What are others thinking?** Some [AI experts](https://aimultiple.com/ai-job-loss#ai-job-loss-predictions) predict the loss of half of entry-level white-collar jobs until 2030. This is [not yet proven](https://aimultiple.com/ai-job-loss#yale-the-budget-lab-2025) except in [fields like translation](https://aimultiple.com/ai-job-loss#most-exposed-roles-and-industries).
  - See the [rest of the Q&A](https://aimultiple.com/ai-job-loss#other-key-questions-regarding-job-losses) including Jevons paradox etc.
  
  ## AI job loss predictions
  
  Expand
  
